<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4208" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Astyăges</span></b> , is,
			m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀστυάγης</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>King of Media</i>, <i>father of
				Mandane</i>, <i>and grandfather of Cyrus</i>, <i>by whom he was deprived of his throne</i>, <i><span class="en">Just. 1, 4
				sq.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>An enemy of Perseus</i>, <i>changed by
				him to stone by means of Medusa's head</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 5,
				203</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
